<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Nov 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Nov 6.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Wednesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain-based international investment group Investcorp announces equity offer to public.</p>
<p>- An Indian pharmaceutical firm seeks joint venture partners in Bahrain.</p>
<p>AKHBAR AL KHALEEJ</p>
<p>- Bahrain to build granite plant. The plant will start production in 1997 with an initial annual output of 120,000 square metres of granite.</p>
